      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm really sorry to hear you're going through this. It's normal to feel lost and empty after such a significant loss, but it's also important to remember that you are more than just a shadow - you're a unique and valuable individual with your own strengths, experiences, and future possibilities. Taking things one day at a time and seeking support from friends, family, or professionals can help in the healing process. Remember that it's okay to grieve and it's okay to take your time. You don't have to define yourself by your past, but rather by your journey of healing and growth.",
